{"about_the_game":"Discover a unique and fully interactive lava simulator !<br>Watch eruptions and lava flows across the stunning landscapes of R\u00e9union Island.<br>This simulation was co-created in 2016 with Eric Chahi, the renowned author of Another World, From Dust, and Paper Beast !<br><br>The simulator lets you interact in real time with eruptions in photorealistic, dynamic environments, revealing a wide range of volcanic structures, from lava fields to cones creation !<br>Create new eruptive fissures, control flow rate, temperature, pressure, and observe the evolution in beautifully rendered 3D landscapes !<br><br>The application is powered by a custom-built graphics and physics engine, specifically designed for this simulation and using the incredible computing power of GPUs !<br><br><strong>Useful Keyboard Shortcuts</strong><br>\u2022 <strong>Mouse, middle button</strong> : move the camera from the observer\u2019s point of view<br>\u2022 <strong>Alt + middle button</strong> : rotate the camera<br>\u2022 <strong>C or double-click</strong> : center the camera on the selected point<br>\u2022 <strong>W</strong> : Wireframe view<br>\u2022 <strong>N</strong> : Normal map view<br>\u2022 <strong>Break</strong> : start / pause the simulation<br>\u2022 <strong>+</strong> / <strong>-</strong> : increase / decrease simulation speed<br>\u2022 <strong>Escape</strong> : open the main menu, with access to scenarios and graphic settings<br>\u2022 <strong>F12</strong> : Steam screen capture","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Lava Lake","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2255740/775b50a61b9e8eaf85f4aed8d5b126413f1822be.jpg"},{"name":"Dolomieu Crater","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2255740/5cfef50802d30ef78373641b15fc9077a5bebbc6.jpg"},{"name":"Lava River","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2255740/b17317a216d78461dd33c36d9a2ee1030d586398.jp